        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Tseyltin, the State argues that the lots have merged under State law and that the lot line between Lot\u202fE and Lot\u202fF has no continuing legal relevance."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners (counsel MR. LAZARUS)",
        "citations": [
