            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 57,
              "start": 57
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioners (counsel MR. LAZARUS), according to Petitioners (counsel MR. LAZARUS), petitioners contend that the value of Lot\u202fE to the Murrs, together with Lot\u202fF, defines the burden, and that ownership of only Lot\u202fE would trigger a hardship exemption allowing construction."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "State",
        "citations": [
          {
